Attribution
------------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project is the unified Python runtime of the Cognitive Fabric. It is
seeded from and extends:

  * KuzuMemPy-MCP — the author's own unpublished Python port of KuzuMem-MCP
    (the MCP graph memory bank), from which this repository's memory-bank core
    is derived.

  * KuzuMem-MCP
    https://github.com/Jakedismo/KuzuMem-MCP
    Copyright (c) Jakedismo (https://github.com/Jakedismo) and KuzuMem-MCP
    contributors; licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0, as declared
    in that repository's README (it ships no LICENSE file).

The memory-bank core's tool surface and data model follow KuzuMem-MCP; the
Python implementation was written by this project's author.

The "Cognitive Fabric" layer built on top of the memory-bank core comprises
in-process (no network sidecar) tree-sitter symbolic (AST) ingestion, a
LanceDB-backed semantic (vector) search layer, and a "dream"/evolution engine
that distills episodic memory into the semantic graph.
